'''Mole-Stache'''{{Refn|[[:File:Mole-Stache Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}} is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Mole-Stache's Species|unknown species]] from an unknown planet.

==Appearance==
Mole-Stache is a rodentoid alien with a green and black jumpsuit in which his ears stick out and also has a pair of white gloves. He has a big blonde mustache and beaver-like teeth, as well as a slight potbelly. He also wears a green and white belt in which the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located.
<gallery hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent" captionalign="center" spacing="small">
AND (238).png|Mole-Stache with maces made from [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]
</gallery>

==Personality==
Mole-Stache speaks in a stereotypical gentleman manner and tends to use high vocabulary.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
BP (459).png|Malleable Mustache
BP (465).png|Elastic Mustache
BP (464).png|Comakinetic Combat
BP (431).png|Mustache Flotation
BP (439).png|Comakinetic Flight
BP (472).png|Strong Mustache
BP (446).png|Enhanced Strength
</gallery>
Mole-Stache's mustache is free-forming and about as maneuverable as any limb, able to stretch and form itself into a variety of shapes. While doing so, he can perform with it feats like wrapping enemies up, forming hands, catching drafts, and carrying himself around. It can also be used as a parachute or propellers.

Mole-Stache appears to have skill in hand-to-hand combat with the mustache, as he easily defeated [[Fistrick]] with it.<ref name="Breakpoint">''[[Breakpoint]]''</ref>

Mole-Stache can fly by twirling his mustache around like a helicopter.<ref name="Breakpoint" /><ref name="Mad World P1">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref>

Mole-Stache's mustache is strong enough to lift a truck<ref name="Breakpoint" /> and a tree.<ref>''[[A New Dawn]]''</ref> On his own and despite his small size, however, Mole-Stache is strong enough to carry a [[Revonnahgander]] with his bare hands while flying and without any trouble.<ref name="Breakpoint" />

If Mole-Stache's mustache is cut or shaved off, it would quickly regenerate.{{Refn|[[:File:Mole-Stache's Mustache Regeneration.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
Mole-Stache can dig into hard surfaces, much like a real mole.{{Refn|''[[A Bad Feeling|Issue 3]]''|name = SSCW|group = SSCW}}

==History==
===1773===
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', 16-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as Mole-Stache defeated young [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] with [[Skurd]]'s help.

===Omniverse===
*Mole-Stache first appeared in ''[[Outbreak]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]] when they tried to fix the malfunctioning [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] before they switched him into [[The Worst]].
*In ''[[Store 23]]'', Mole-Stache was one of several aliens [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] was showcasing for [[Ben 23]].
*In ''[[No Honor Among Bros]]'', Mole-Stache defeated [[Yetta]] off-screen.{{Refn|[[:File:Mole-Stache vs. Yetta Proof.png]]|group = DJW|name = Imgur}}
*In ''[[Breakpoint]]'', Mole-Stache flew himself and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] to safety and defeated [[Fistrick]].
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', Mole-Stache flew with [[Nighty Knight]] to find [[Mad Rook]] and met [[Will Harangue (Mad Dimension)|Mad Harangue]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Mole-Stache appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

