==Etymology==
Mole-Stache's name is a portmanteau of the words "mole", referring his appearance, and "mustache", which alludes to his ability to fight with his malleable mustache.

==Trivia==
*The design for Mole-Stache came from [[Jerry]], drawn by [[Steven Choi]] or [[Chap Yaep]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steven and Chap Came Up With Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*In his first appearance, Mole-Stache shared the same voice as Ben due to the Omnitrix malfunctioning. The out-of-universe reason for this was because the crew originally did not envision him as a usable alien for later episodes.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Explaination.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Mole-Stache's voice was eventually changed to a [[Wikipedia:United Kingdom|British]] accent in ''[[Breakpoint]]'' because the crew liked how he turned out.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Changed.png]]|group = DJW}} Mole-Stache speaks with this accent because the British are stereotyped as behaving gentlemanly.
*Mole-Stache is one of four aliens unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]]; the other three being [[Walkatrout]], [[Pesky Dust]], and [[The Worst]].<ref>''[[Outbreak]]''</ref>
*[[Ben 23]] does not have an alternate counterpart to Mole-Stache in his [[Hero Watch|Omnitrix]].<ref>''[[Store 23]]''</ref> 
**Both Ben Prime and Ben 23 finds Mole-Stache to be lamer than [[Nighty Knight]].<ref name="Mad World P1"/>
*Mole-Stache was initially planned to appear in ''[[No Honor Among Bros]]'', where he would master his powers during a fight with [[Yetta]], but the scene had to be cut for time.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = Imgur}}{{Refn|http://tannertrue.tumblr.com/post/100050979277/as-promised-here-is-the-animatic-for-a-scene-that|group = am}}
*[[Albedo]] is unable to transform into Mole-Stache.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Does Not Have Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Mole-Stache was included in ''[[Ben 10: Omni-Charged]]'' game at PHL Collective's request{{Refn|[[:File:PHL Wanted Mole-Stache.png]]|group = DR}} because he worked well with the VR mechanics for the game.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/KQtQtvFUhUc|group = NM}} However he was not planned to appear in the [[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]].{{Refn|[[:File:RB Mole-Stache Exclusive To Omni-Charged.png]]|group = DR}}

